Subject: May have found another issue with ordinal model
Message-ID: <rFcQRfATOcg.R50713X7AQAJ@brms-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/brms-users/c/rFcQRfATOcg/m/R50713X7AQAJ>
