I think the chains might just have converged into different modes. Check out

plot(fit)

You can als see the model fit graphically via

plot(marginal_effects(fit), points = TRUE)

You might want to fit the model with only one chain (chains = 1) and see if this converges (to rule out the multiple mode problem).

