This worked!

prior1 <- c(prior(normal(0.0, 0.5), nlpar='alpha'),
            prior(uniform(0.5,1), lb=0.5, up=1, nlpar='lambda'),
            prior(normal(0.0, 0.5, nlpar='beta'))

Thanks!

